<title>JAPAN: Canon Copyer -6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Canon Copyer -6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.21		vs	   33.72</p>
<p> Operating	    1.31		vs	  596    million</p>
<p> Current		1.58		vs	  889    million</p>
<p> Net		  819    million    vs	  436    million</p>
<p> EPS		   38.53 yen	  vs	   20.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Canon Copyer Sales Co Ltd is a sales company for Canon Sales Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
